[/list]

Hi everybody, here are a few updates:
[list]
[*] Bixxewoschd reviewed the German translation;
[*] we added an option to the main menu screen to enable/disable text autoadvance, so that you can now manually advance text with a mouse click;
[*] as it was a source of confusion, we removed the keyboard shortcut to display the current version which is now displayed on the main menu screen.
[/list]
